{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/60071-now-what","id":60071,"title":"Now What?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-28T13:09:12-08:00","id":60071,"title":"Now What?","content":"My landlady just passed away. She was an old, dear friend of mine, and I\u2019m going to miss her. But her passing leads to a more immediate concern on my part: with her passing, I\u2019m out of a home. Life just became decidedly interesting, and not in a good way.<br /> <br /> UPDATE: to give a sense of my predicament, I\u2019ve been paying $400/month for my room here; and I\u2019ve just barely been scraping by. The cheapest apartments I can find near here cost twice that much.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 01-28-2014, 04:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T13:38:12-08:00","id":60092,"title":"","content":"Well, my first thought is to check out the local laws. Generally evicting someone requires giving written notice and a certain amount of time depending on the area. <br /> <br /> My second thought is to talk to the executor and the inheritor of the property to find out what is happening with the property.<br /> <br /> My third thought is that you should probably be looking in room to rent adverts rather than apartment adverts to save that bill a bit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T14:18:34-08:00","id":60121,"title":"","content":"I'd suggest looking for a roommate. I also recommend getting a roommate in a place with key-locks on the bedroom doors.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: Unless stated otherwise, all examples I give are completely random and almost assuredly pulled from my nethers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1575-dairugger","name":"Dairugger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1575_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T16:53:37-08:00","id":60230,"title":"","content":"Same advice...my daughter hunted down an apartment when the last place turned them down. She got accepted because she had the security payment in hand and first month's rent. She and her dad paid out the pet deposit. Look into some of the collegiate apartments where you pay for the room, not the whole apartment. You would be sharing with someone but if there are locks on the doors, its worth the price.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T17:21:06-08:00","id":60247,"title":"","content":"I know in NJ it's pretty difficult to evict a tenant that keeps everything paid up on time, and follows all the rules and so forth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-28T22:25:24-08:00","id":60480,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the advice; it really helped, and it looks like I\u2019ll have a new place in about an hour. <br /> <br /> A clarification: I said \u201cmy landlady\u201d; the truth is that I had an informal subletting arrangement with the primary renter of the condo I\u2019m staying in, and she\u2019s who I was referring to. And I just found out that while I had been prompt with my payments to her, <i>she</i> was a few months behind on her payments to the actual owner of the property. I don\u2019t have any legal legs to stand on to fight eviction; but that\u2019s looking like it will be a moot point very soon. <br /> <br /> Next up: how to get my stuff packed up and either moved or sold and shipped in as little time as possible. I have a large collection of roleplaying books that it\u2019s time to separate with, including complete runs of every nWoD line from Promethean to Geist (though that\u2019s not saying much in the case of Geist); but it\u2019s been a while since I\u2019ve taken inventory of what exactly I have. I\u2019m also not the most organized person in the world; I have a friend who will be coming by over the next several days to help me excavate my old room.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-29T04:51:30-08:00","id":60635,"title":"","content":"I'm glad you found a new place. I was in a similar situation a while back... now I live with my parents again. There just wasn't enough time to find something else. Situations like these really put you on the spot and have a tendency to throw your whole life into upheaval. The faster you're able to respond and fix it, the better. Good to know you've managed to do that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2054-whim","name":"Whim","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T04:17:35-08:00","id":61454,"title":"","content":"Go/call your local department of human services, they may be able to point you to who handles a list of low income housing vouchers. It ruined my life moving, I wish I had help. Go there see if they can help you. 211 is a number you can also call provide you with a list of numbers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}